@startuml
' Pass-through case: a <stdlib> include is NOT an Antora resource id, so the feature
' must leave it untouched and let the Kroki server resolve it (Kroki bundles the
' PlantUML stdlib, incl. C4-PlantUML). Remote http(s) includes are passed through the
' same way. Only example$… ids are inlined.
!include <C4/C4_Context>

Person(user, "User")
System(demo, "Antora Kroki demo")
Rel(user, demo, "previews diagrams")
@enduml
